==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Ralts}}.
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Platinum|Ralts|89}} from the {{TCG|Platinum}} expansion.
*{{m|Teleport}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Ralts}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

